public static Object findMostPopularColor(List<Car> cars) {
    Map<String, Integer> colorCount = new HashMap<>();
    int maxCount = 0;
    String mostPopularColor = "";
    for (Car car : cars) {
        String color = car.getColor();
        int count = colorCount.getOrDefault(color, 0);
        colorCount.put(color, count + 1);

        if (count + 1 > maxCount) {
            maxCount = count + 1;
            mostPopularColor = color;
        }
    }

    return new AbstractMap.SimpleImmutableEntry<>(mostPopularColor, maxCount);
}
```

Optimizations in the Kotlin version:
1. `getOrDefault` simplified iterating over the collection.
2. Implicit tuple returned by the lambda.

